0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 742 Td (Purpose) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 722 Td (Grevya follows a hybrid model. This policy sets out when employees may work remotely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 707 Td (and what we expect from each other to stay productive, connected and secure.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 676 Td (Eligibility) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 656 Td (Employees who have completed their probation may work remotely for up to 2 days a week) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 641 Td (in agreement with their manager. Longer remote periods, for example for family reasons) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 626 Td (or relocation, need approval from the function head and the People Success team.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 595 Td (Working hours and availability) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 575 Td (Core collaboration hours are 11:00 to 17:00 IST. Be reachable on Slack and your phone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 560 Td (during these hours, keep your calendar up to date and join meetings with video where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 545 Td (possible.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 524 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 524 Td (Punch in through Attendance > Remote Check-in with a live selfie and location.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 503 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 503 Td (Mark planned remote days on the team calendar at least a day in advance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 69 482 Td (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 80 482 Td (Attend in person when your manager calls a team day or client visit.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 451 Td (Equipment and security) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 431 Td (Grevya provides a laptop and a one-time home-office allowance of Rs. 10,000. Work only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 416 Td (on company devices, connect through the corporate VPN and never use public Wi-Fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 401 Td (without the VPN. Lock your screen whenever you step away.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 370 Td (Health and wellbeing) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 350 Td (Set up an ergonomic workspace, take regular breaks and switch off after work. Talk to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 335 Td (your manager or the People Success team if remote work is affecting your wellbeing.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 304 Td (Compliance and exceptions) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 284 Td (Violations of this policy may lead to disciplinary action up to and including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 269 Td (termination of employment, in line with the Grevya Code of Conduct and applicable law.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 248 Td (Exceptions must be approved in writing by the People Success team and the relevant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 233 Td (function head. Approved exceptions are recorded in People Success and reviewed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 218 Td (annually.) Tj ET
0.216 0.325 0.722 rg
BT /F2 13 Tf 64 187 Td (Review and contact) Tj ET
0.12 0.16 0.23 rg
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 167 Td (This policy is reviewed at least once a year by the People Success team. Questions can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 152 Td (be raised through More Apps > HR Helpdesk in the People Success portal or by writing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 64 137 Td (to people@grevya.com.) Tj ET
